# The web app is a development tool, not something production serves. server.js
# already keeps it behind SERVE_WEB_APP; leaving it out of the image as well
# means a stray environment variable cannot put the whole product back on the
# open web for free next to a paid iOS app. Consequence to know about: setting
# SERVE_WEB_APP on a deployed instance gets 404s rather than the app, which is
# the intended answer. Run it locally instead. See README.md.
